{
    "title": "Super Simple - Kids Songs",
    "description": "Make Learning Fun and Super Simple!\r\n\r\nTrusted by parents and educators worldwide, our app offers a safe, ad-free environment packed with beloved nursery rhymes, educational content and games for toddlers.\r\n\r\n*** Winner of the Creative Child Awards - App Of The Year, Parent Teachers Choice Award, Mom\u2019s Choice Award, Family Choice Award and received The National Parenting Centre\u2019s Seal Of Approval. ***\r\n\r\n**All Your Favorites for Preschool**\r\n\r\nWhether it\u2019s Noodle & Pals, The Bumble Nums or Caitie\u2019s Classroom, you\u2019ll find all the songs and shows from your favorite YouTube channels and more educational and entertaining content that will help your little ones with early learning.\r\n\r\n**Play and Learn**\r\n\r\nCount bubbles, run Carl\u2019s Car Wash, play sports, collect food for a picnic and match pictures all in one app. Children have so many options with a growing library of games and interactive storybooks full of their favorite characters from Super Simple.\r\n\r\n**Features**\r\n\r\n- No ads, ever, just fun.\r\n- Download videos to watch anywhere, anytime, even without internet.\r\n- Early learning about animals, language, gestures, counting, ABCs and more!\r\n- Every week we add new kid-safe educational songs, shows, and games.\r\n- Create your own custom playlists with your favorite nursery rhymes and singalongs.\r\n- Watch all our kids songs from YouTube like Twinkle Twinkle Little Star, Wheels On The Bus, This Is The Way, and Baby Shark!\r\n- All your favorite Super Simple shows like Carl\u2019s Car Wash, The Bumble Nums, Caitie\u2019s Classroom, and Finny The Shark.\r\n- Navigating is easy for little ones. They\u2019ll have fun exploring and finding all their favorite content.\r\n- See our new content here first!Get started today for free and unlock full access to all your favorite content.\r\n\r\n**Subscription Details**\r\n\r\nTo access all the content you may purchase an auto-renewing subscription through the Super Simple App:\u2022 We offer you a 7-day free trial upon selection of the subscription.\r\n\r\n- Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (at the duration selected) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n- Current subscription may not be canceled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your iTunes Account Settings after purchase\r\n\r\n**Privacy Policy**\r\n\r\nhttps://supersimple.com/app-terms-of-service-in-app/\r\n\r\nhttps://supersimple.com/app-privacy-policy-in-app/\r\n\r\n**About Super Simple**\r\n\r\nWe started as teachers using music and dance in our classroom, and we\u2019re proud to be able to continue that tradition with this fun, ad-free app. With over 67 billion views, Super Simple is now home to some of the most well known and most loved children\u2019s content on YouTube.\r\n\r\nFollow us on Instagram, Pinterest, and TikTok: @supersimpleofficial",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make Learning Fun and Super Simple!<br><br>Trusted by parents and educators worldwide, our app offers a safe, ad-free environment packed with beloved nursery rhymes, educational content and games for toddlers.<br><br>*** Winner of the Creative Child Awards - App Of The Year, Parent Teachers Choice Award, Mom\u2019s Choice Award, Family Choice Award and received The National Parenting Centre\u2019s Seal Of Approval. ***<br><br>**All Your Favorites for Preschool**<br><br>Whether it\u2019s Noodle &amp; Pals, The Bumble Nums or Caitie\u2019s Classroom, you\u2019ll find all the songs and shows from your favorite YouTube channels and more educational and entertaining content that will help your little ones with early learning.<br><br>**Play and Learn**<br><br>Count bubbles, run Carl\u2019s Car Wash, play sports, collect food for a picnic and match pictures all in one app. Children have so many options with a growing library of games and interactive storybooks full of their favorite characters from Super Simple.<br><br>**Features**<br><br>- No ads, ever, just fun.<br>- Download videos to watch anywhere, anytime, even without internet.<br>- Early learning about animals, language, gestures, counting, ABCs and more!<br>- Every week we add new kid-safe educational songs, shows, and games.<br>- Create your own custom playlists with your favorite nursery rhymes and singalongs.<br>- Watch all our kids songs from YouTube like Twinkle Twinkle Little Star, Wheels On The Bus, This Is The Way, and Baby Shark!<br>- All your favorite Super Simple shows like Carl\u2019s Car Wash, The Bumble Nums, Caitie\u2019s Classroom, and Finny The Shark.<br>- Navigating is easy for little ones. They\u2019ll have fun exploring and finding all their favorite content.<br>- See our new content here first!Get started today for free and unlock full access to all your favorite content.<br><br>**Subscription Details**<br><br>To access all the content you may purchase an auto-renewing subscription through the Super Simple App:\u2022 We offer you a 7-day free trial upon selection of the subscription.<br><br>- Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (at the duration selected) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br>- Current subscription may not be canceled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your iTunes Account Settings after purchase<br><br>**Privacy Policy**<br><br>https://supersimple.com/app-terms-of-service-in-app/<br><br>https://supersimple.com/app-privacy-policy-in-app/<br><br>**About Super Simple**<br><br>We started as teachers using music and dance in our classroom, and we\u2019re proud to be able to continue that tradition with this fun, ad-free app. With over 67 billion views, Super Simple is now home to some of the most well known and most loved children\u2019s content on YouTube.<br><br>Follow us on Instagram, Pinterest, and TikTok: @supersimpleofficial",
